## RC5 exact-main managed v2 proof bridge

PR #422 merged the schema-valid Test Lab v2 authority at `main@16d36231e31444d01a7ca29b248d5369c76aa172`, independently of this bridge. This second-stage bridge therefore avoids the same-merge registration race that caused failed receipt Issue #421.

The bridge:

- verifies exact current main and the registered target workflow name/path/active state;
- records the existing dispatch-run set;
- dispatches one exact-source `firebase-test-lab-managed.yml` run;
- requires exactly one uniquely new exact-source run;
- waits fail-closed for completion;
- downloads and validates the sanitized receipt and standalone matrix;
- requires API 33, a current API 35–36 target, 2–3 devices, zero retries, no orchestrator/video/performance/automatic login, synthetic/public-safe data, and production authorization false;
- publishes a dedicated success or failure issue and links #261;
- contains no OIDC permission, Google authentication, `gcloud`, direct Test Lab command, IAM/bucket mutation, secret-value access, participant data, or production authority.

A separate parser/static contract validates the bridge before merge. Failed attempts #421 remain preserved.

Refs #261 #419 #421 #422.

